SYNTAX
======
reply <message>
 
DESCRIPTION
===========
replyto <player>
The 'replyto' command sets the name of the player to which the 'reply'
command will send a message. The 'tell' and 'reply' commands automatically
set this for you, so use 'replyto' only if you wish to manually set it.
This can be handy if you are talking to several people, and want to only
reply to a specific person
 
